      "content": "the throat tightness is actually getting kinda worse now and my voice sounds a bit raspy. if i take the benadryl right now, how long should i wait before i start worrying? is there any way i can tell if it's just a mild reaction versus something serious without actually going to a clinic? i'm really trying to avoid the hospital if i can.",
